{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "先做这几件",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 72.81,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "按角色，各做一件事。",
   "spoken": "按决色，各做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "写智能账户的，签名覆盖链 ID 和入口合约地址，管理操作防跨链重放。",
   "spoken": "写智能账户的，签名覆盖链 ID 和入口合约地址，管理操作防跨链虫放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.532,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 4.63,
   "speechEnd": 10.487
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "做钱包的，只委托给自己审计过的实现，批量逐项解码。",
   "spoken": "做钱包的，只委托给自己审计过的实现，批亮逐项解码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.544,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 11.642,
   "speechEnd": 16.046
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "写合约的，别再用交易发起者，判断对方是普通地址。",
   "spoken": "写合约的，别再用交易发起者，判断对方是普通地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.116,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 17.214,
   "speechEnd": 21.333
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "托管方，不需要委托的热钱包，一律拒签这类授权，自有地址的代码一变，立刻告警。",
   "spoken": "托管方，不需要委托的热钱包，一律拒签这类授权，自有地址的代码一变，立刻告警。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.4,
   "dur": 7.056,
   "speechStart": 22.498,
   "speechEnd": 28.605
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "普通用户，网站请你升级成智能账户，拒绝，看不懂批量里的任何一步，不签。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，网站请你升级成智能账户，拒绝，看不懂批亮里的任何一步，不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 29.676,
   "dur": 7.536,
   "speechStart": 29.774,
   "speechEnd": 36.393
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "用完的会话密钥和 Permit2 旧授权，记得撤销。",
   "spoken": "用完的会话密钥和 Permit2 旧授权，记得撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 37.432,
   "dur": 4.632,
   "speechStart": 37.53,
   "speechEnd": 41.22
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "回到开头的问题，服务关了，委托不会自动失效。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题，服务关了，委托不会自动失效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 42.284,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 42.382,
   "speechEnd": 46.167
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "委托是写在地址上的链上状态，要靠一笔新的授权清零。",
   "spoken": "委托是写在地址上的链上状态，要靠一笔新的授权清零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 47.232,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 47.33,
   "speechEnd": 51.734
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "那次事件里，约 3 小时 50 分后，委托才被清零。",
   "spoken": "那次事件里，约 3 小时 50 分后，委托才被清零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 52.804,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 52.902,
   "speechEnd": 56.664
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "停掉链下服务，无法撤销链上的委托。",
   "spoken": "停掉链下服务，无法撤销链上的委托。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 57.728,
   "dur": 3.672,
   "speechStart": 57.826,
   "speechEnd": 60.564
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "账户变成了合约，签名就是在授权代码，签之前，先看清它允许什么。",
   "spoken": "账户变成了合约，签名就是在授权代码，签之前，先看清它允许什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 61.62,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 61.718,
   "speechEnd": 67.194
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "下一集讲共识层与链本身的安全。",
